CairoFlow: third-party material and its terms

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers CairoFlow's original source code only. The material below is
not original to this project and keeps its own terms; nothing here relicenses it.

Records in experiments/, data/geometry/ and cache/ are kept byte for byte, because their SHA-256
values are pinned. Where a notice or field inside one differs from this file, this file applies.

